    "answer": {
      "short": "Join the daily visitor counts in order: Mon 1250, Tue 2500, Wed 2800, Thu 2800, Fri 3200, Sat 6500, Sun 7000.",
      "worked": "Label the horizontal axis with the seven days and the vertical axis with the number of people, using a scale from 0 to 7000. Plot each table value and join consecutive points with straight line segments.",
      "solutionDiagrams": [
        {
          "id": "p10-q6-line",
          "role": "solution",
          "format": "tikz",
          "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[],\"reference\":\"page 10 question 6 source table\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=0.65cm,font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\draw[step=1,line width=0.25pt] (0,0) grid (6,7);\n\\draw[->,line width=0.5pt] (0,0)--(6.5,0);\n\\draw[->,line width=0.5pt] (0,0)--(0,7.5);\n\\foreach \\x/\\d in {0/Mon,1/Tue,2/Wed,3/Thu,4/Fri,5/Sat,6/Sun}{\\draw[line width=0.4pt] (\\x,0)--(\\x,-0.12);\\node[below] at (\\x,-0.14) {\\d};}\n\\foreach \\y/\\v in {0/0,1/1000,2/2000,3/3000,4/4000,5/5000,6/6000,7/7000}{\\draw[line width=0.4pt] (0,\\y)--(-0.1,\\y);\\node[left] at (-0.12,\\y) {\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}\\v\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};}\n\\draw[line width=0.8pt] (0,1.25)--(1,2.5)--(2,2.8)--(3,2.8)--(4,3.2)--(5,6.5)--(6,7);\n\\foreach \\x/\\y in {0/1.25,1/2.5,2/2.8,3/2.8,4/3.2,5/6.5,6/7}{\\fill (\\x,\\y) circle (1.5pt);}\n\\node[below] at (3,-0.8) {Day of the week};\n\\node[rotate=90] at (-2.0,3.5) {Number of people};\n\\node[above] at (3,7.8) {Daily museum visits};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
